<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Republic Industries.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Republic Industries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert M. Cohen &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Republic Industries Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- cited stock's &quot;extreme discounted valuation with respect to its own internal growth as well as in comparison to the industries in which it competes.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said analyst Keith Bossey set a 12-month price target of $36 per share.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 1-6/16 to 21-11/16.</p>
